 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about what you eat",
   "texto": [
    "Liker means «gustar»: Jeg liker ost equals «I like cheese.». To deny, ikke goes after the verb: Jeg liker ikke fisk («I don't like fish.»).",
    "Drikker is «bebo» or «baby»; like other verbs in present, it does not change with jeg and du. Eller means «or» when chosen between options."
